  m_Name: NoteData_MummyCase
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  statueName: The Mummy Case
  pages:
  - 'This is a sarcophagus, a special case

    that held a mummy inside!


    Ancient
    Egyptians believed that after

    you die, you travel to a magical world

    called
    the Afterlife.'
  - "To prepare for that journey, they\ncarefully wrapped the body in cloth,\nthat's
    what a mummy is!\n\nThey painted beautiful pictures\non the case to protect the
    person\non their long trip. \U0001F31F\n\nDon't worry, it's just a case now.\nNo
    mummies jumping out! \U0001F604"
  statueIllustration: {fileID: 465063712599069340, guid: 3c3fddc5e7138f849b59002964f2beef, type: 3}
